# Release archive export exclusions — dev-only paths not needed by the
# End-User Package. GitHub tag tarball downloads (scripts/install_nae_beta.command)
# and `git archive` respect export-ignore. See
# docs/END_USER_PACKAGE_GATE2A_PACKAGING_SURFACE_AUDIT.md for the audit that
# identified these paths (NAE/ alone is ~93.5% of git-tracked repo size and is
# only needed by the opt-in nae_pd module, disabled by default for end users).

NAE/ export-ignore
.automation/ export-ignore
test_seal_*/ export-ignore
